Third-party parts

The following parts keep their own licences and are not covered by the notice above. Each was checked against the
asset provenance log; every other staged image, mesh and Blender file is original work of the copyright holder.

- OpenStreetMap data: the four .osm extracts under tools/city/data/ (Overpass API, bases 2026-11-15, 2026-11-16 and
  2026-11-23), and the geometry built from them. Open Database Licence 1.0, (c) OpenStreetMap contributors.
  https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright
- Poly Haven scans (CC0 1.0, https://polyhaven.com/license): white_rough_plaster, concrete_wall_008, rusty_metal_02,
  concrete_floor_worn_001 and asphalt_02, used as detail inside the trim sheets T_FrontageTrim_A*.png and
  T_RoadEdgeTrim_A*.png.
- Noto Sans Bold, SIL Open Font Licence 1.1 (https://openfontlicense.org): lettering rendered into the T_AdFace_*.png
  images. The font file itself is not included.
- Shapely 2.2.0, installed into tools/city/vendor/ by the workflow: BSD 3-Clause licence; it bundles GEOS (LGPL 2.1).
  Both licence texts are kept in third_party/shapely/.
- Any other vendored code keeps the licence file it came with.
